{"action_zh": "把听觉期待视为特定语料和风格中学得的概率倾向；候选排序应服从当前风格与上下文。", "avoid_zh": "避免把一种文化或体裁的常见模式宣称为普遍旋律定律。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "huron", "style conditioning"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-001", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "huron", "style conditioning"], "title_zh": "统计学习边界"}
{"action_zh": "默认优先搜索小音程延续，再把较大跳进保留给结构重音或动机身份。", "avoid_zh": "避免把级进率直接等同于审美质量，或禁止具有明确功能的大跳。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "proximity", "stepwise"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-002", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "proximity", "stepwise"], "title_zh": "近距离延续"}
{"action_zh": "旋律接近当前音域边缘后，优先测试向中位音区回归的后续走向。", "avoid_zh": "避免使用全曲固定音域中心；只依据当前乐句和声部统计。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "tessitura", "mean regression"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-003", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "tessitura", "mean regression"], "title_zh": "音域中心回归"}
{"action_zh": "大跳之后优先比较反向级进候选，并记录该选择是否同时缓解音域边缘压力。", "avoid_zh": "避免把跳后反向当作孤立心理法则；它也可能是有限音域的统计副作用。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "post-skip reversal", "tessitura"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-004", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "post-skip reversal", "tessitura"], "title_zh": "跳进后转向"}
{"action_zh": "若大跳把旋律推向乐句极端音区，降低继续同向外扩候选的排序。", "avoid_zh": "避免仅凭一次大跳拒绝候选；检查后续是否有恢复路径。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "registral direction", "boundary"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-005", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "registral direction", "boundary"], "title_zh": "音域外扩警戒"}
{"action_zh": "局部高点或低点出现后，在数个事件内寻找回返、停留或句法解释。", "avoid_zh": "避免要求机械回到完全相同的音高。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "registral return", "contour"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-006", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "registral return", "contour"], "title_zh": "音区回返"}
{"action_zh": "大跳后若反向填充部分音程空隙，可作为连贯性加分项而非硬规则。", "avoid_zh": "避免把 gap-fill 与跳后反向重复计分成两个独立证据。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "gap fill", "proxy"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-007", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "gap fill", "proxy"], "title_zh": "空隙填充谨慎解释"}
{"action_zh": "乐句末音同时结合调性稳定度、时值停驻和接近方向评估闭合感。", "avoid_zh": "避免只因末音属于主和弦就判定终止充分。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "closure", "tonal anchoring"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-008", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "closure", "tonal anchoring"], "title_zh": "终点稳定性"}
{"action_zh": "在强拍和长时值位置提高结构音或可解释非和弦音的权重。", "avoid_zh": "避免让所有强拍都机械重复主音或和弦根音。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "metrical anchoring", "structure tone"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-009", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "metrical anchoring", "structure tone"], "title_zh": "强拍锚定"}
{"action_zh": "显著非和弦音应有邻接、经过、延留或明确色彩功能，并在局部得到解释。", "avoid_zh": "避免把每个半音都惩罚为错误，或把每个半音都解释成新和声。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "dissonance", "resolution"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-010", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "dissonance", "resolution"], "title_zh": "非和弦音去向"}
{"action_zh": "旋律性三全音之后优先搜索短距离反向解决或和声上可解释的延宕。", "avoid_zh": "避免在没有和声语境时把所有三全音一律判为非法。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "tritone", "resolution"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-011", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "tritone", "resolution"], "title_zh": "三全音后续"}
{"action_zh": "短小级进可以维持方向形成动量；连续过长同向运动则检查是否缺少转折。", "avoid_zh": "避免把方向延续和方向改变同时设为不可调和的硬约束。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "directional inertia", "motion"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-012", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "directional inertia", "motion"], "title_zh": "方向惯性限度"}
{"action_zh": "短乐句优先保留一个最显著音域高点，并让接近与离开方式支持其句法角色。", "avoid_zh": "避免多个同强度极端高点稀释高潮，除非目标是序列或持续张力。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "climax", "arch"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-013", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "climax", "arch"], "title_zh": "单一结构高点"}
{"action_zh": "把中后段升高、末端回落作为一种可比较的轮廓候选，而非唯一正确形状。", "avoid_zh": "避免把西方民歌的拱形统计直接推广到所有风格。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "melodic arch", "phrase contour"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-014", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "melodic arch", "phrase contour"], "title_zh": "拱形作为语料倾向"}
{"action_zh": "在闭合目标下测试音区回落、较长末音和稳定级数的组合。", "avoid_zh": "避免要求开放式、问句式或上行终止也必须下降。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "declination", "phrase ending"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-015", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "declination", "phrase ending"], "title_zh": "句尾下降倾向"}
{"action_zh": "先用可识别重复建立预测，再只改变结尾、重音或一个音程参数。", "avoid_zh": "避免在预测尚未建立前连续改写全部材料。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "prediction", "motif repetition"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-016", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "prediction", "motif repetition"], "title_zh": "重复建立预测"}
{"action_zh": "需要惊异时只违反一个已建立的期待维度，并用后续事件给出解释或新规则。", "avoid_zh": "避免随机偏离同时破坏调性、节奏、轮廓和织体。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "surprise", "controlled violation"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-017", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "surprise", "controlled violation"], "title_zh": "受控违背"}
{"action_zh": "候选可通过延迟落点或增加局部不确定性累积张力，但应在计划位置降低不确定性。", "avoid_zh": "避免把持续不可预测当作持续高张力的可靠替代。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "tension", "uncertainty"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-018", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "tension", "uncertainty"], "title_zh": "不确定性与张力"}
{"action_zh": "规划证据区分事前可预测性、事件当下反差与事后结构解释，不把它们压成单一分数。", "avoid_zh": "避免宣称一个代理指标完整复现 ITPRA 的心理与情绪反应。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "ITPRA", "auditability"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-019", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "ITPRA", "auditability"], "title_zh": "预测与反应分离"}
{"action_zh": "以当前风格的音阶、半音率、惯用跳进和句法统计调整期待评分。", "avoid_zh": "避免用古典阈值直接惩罚爵士、调式或现代材料。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "style vocabulary", "conditioning"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-020", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "style vocabulary", "conditioning"], "title_zh": "风格词汇条件化"}
{"action_zh": "多声部乐谱先分别提取每条旋律线，再计算期待特征；不要按 XML 事件顺序混合声部。", "avoid_zh": "避免把同时发声的不同声部当成一条旋律产生伪大跳。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "voice separation", "polyphony"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.92, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-021", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "voice separation", "polyphony"], "title_zh": "声部独立建模"}
{"action_zh": "在休止、终止、长时值或明确段落边界处弱化此前方向惯性的影响。", "avoid_zh": "避免让上一乐句末端的大跳永久约束下一乐句开头。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "phrase boundary", "reset"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-022", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "phrase boundary", "reset"], "title_zh": "乐句边界重置"}
{"action_zh": "编辑候选同时报告绝对期待分与相对原谱变化，优先避免新引入的明显问题。", "avoid_zh": "避免因原谱已有非常规写法而拒绝所有不新增问题的局部修改。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "baseline", "relative improvement"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-023", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "baseline", "relative improvement"], "title_zh": "原谱相对改进"}
{"action_zh": "把期待分用于发现塌缩、大跳未解决和弱收束，并保留人工试听与盲评边界。", "avoid_zh": "避免声称高期待分必然更好听或更有创意。", "domain": "melodic_expectation", "goals": ["melodic_expectation", "evaluation", "human review"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.95, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-EXPECT-024", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["melodic_expectation", "evaluation", "human review"], "title_zh": "代理指标非审美结论"}
